Hello there! 👋

<br/>

I had some spare time and decided to create a new project. It is a modern, interactive color palette generator that creates beautiful color schemes and generates ready-to-use configuration code for popular CSS frameworks.

<br/>

What I made it? I wanted to create something simple as I found myself typing over and over again the same questions to the LLM. "Generate a color palette for the project" or "Generate similar colors" or "Validate the color against the WCAG standards". Now I don't have to do that or use different tools to get what I need. Hopefully you will find it useful as well.

<br/>

👉 Check it out [here](https://mspiechowicz.github.io/project-palette)!

<br/>

That is all for now. Stay healthy and keep coding!

<br/>

Greetings,

Maciej
